                "text": "\ud83d\udea8Organ donations have saved countless American lives. Unfortunately, SERIOUS concerns have been raised about certain organ procurement organizations attempting to obtain organs from patients WHOSE LIVES CAN STILL BE SAVED!\n\nToday, I questioned representatives of the United Network for Organ Sharing, the Organ Procurement & Transplantation Network, and the Network for Hope about these DISTURBING reports and why former officials associated with these practices are STILL serving at the Network for Hope.",
